      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I need some help drafting an email to a customer. \n\nThey're pretty upset because their recent order of our premium serum was delayed at the Memphis sorting facility due to a logistics error on our end. They're asking for a full refund on their shipping costs since it didn't arrive by the promised date.\n\nCan you write a professional and empathetic email for me? I want to apologize for the delay, confirm that we are processing their shipping refund immediately, and let them know we're working to ensure it doesn't happen again. Keep it sounding like a high-end skincare brand—polished and sincere.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
