      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft email for you:\n\nSubject: A Personal Apology for the Delay in Your Premium Serum\n\nDear [Customer's Name],\n\nWe want to start by apologizing sincerely for the inconvenience caused by the delay in your recent order of our premium serum at the Memphis sorting facility. This mistake is in no way representative of the exceptional quality and service we strive to provide, and we're deeply sorry for the disappointment it has caused.\n\nAs a gesture of goodwill, we're processing your shipping refund immediately, and you can expect the credit to reflect on your account within the next 3-5 business days. We understand the frustration that comes with not receiving your order on time, and we want to assure you that we're taking concrete steps to rectify this issue and prevent it from happening again in the future.\n\nIf you have any further concerns or questions, please don't hesitate to reach out. We value your loyalty and appreciate the opportunity to make things right. Thank you for your patience and understanding.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]\n[Brand Name]",
