      "content": "That's a good start, definitely professional. \n\nCould you try another version though? Maybe one that's a bit more \"human\" and less \"corporate template\"? I want the customer to feel like there's a real person behind the brand who actually realizes how annoying it is when things just... go wrong unexpectedly during shipping. Just a little more warmth, if that makes sense.",
